{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":70296,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793454266993,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2015,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bShIbcLSZCFq2wLvxh8gw5xUAbl.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"1270799","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takeru, Usagi and Ikaruga are joined by a new squad member, Otori Ouka, an elite who'd lost her license for unusual reasons. The squad witnesses her impressive skills.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-10-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":9.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mVmfYU1tR67guGLPzHntAVNTGaH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mVmfYU1tR67guGLPzHntAVNTGaH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70296/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"1270801","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Takeru told Ouka, \"I won't give up on trying to be your comrade.\" But then, while visiting a certain grave site, he learns the tragic reason Ouka hates witches. The deep sorrow in Ouka's eyes when she tells Takeru, \"other people are obstacles for my revenge,\" renders Takeru speechless.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-10-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zfSkff26VZJvrYiwhmjxB63KNoc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zfSkff26VZJvrYiwhmjxB63KNoc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70296/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"1334051","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sparks fly when Nikaido Mari, a Valhalla witch with amnesia, joins the Small Fry Platoon. Can they successfully guard her? Or will Haunted get to her first...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-10-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eQbv9obRUDkxmhsc9EzNPzixdLP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eQbv9obRUDkxmhsc9EzNPzixdLP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70296/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"1334065","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"In the chairman's office, Ouka finds files documenting Mari's crimes... The next day, the Mock Battle Tournament has entered the second round: Kyoya's 15th Platoon against Takeru's 35th. But during the battle, Yoshimizu, Kyoya's childhood friend and platoon member, has strange black thorns burst out of her body! \"I've come to rescue you, my sweet Mari-san!\" Emerging from the black thorns is the necromancer, Haunted.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-10-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j7b7QvKPP7T7CG9RktZDrXYh4gU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j7b7QvKPP7T7CG9RktZDrXYh4gU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70296/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"1334066","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A cocky boy from Usagi's past shakes up things at Anti-Magic Academy by proposing the reinstatement of the witch hunt festival. Can the Small Fry Platoon earn enough points in this festival to convince Usagi's mother to keep her in school?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-11-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":9.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9EPhfHsC6tUycvCd3jSDkDyuZNA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"http