ust like breathing air. Resurrecting these Dark Elves... was Isuka's mission. Ikaruga rushes back to Isuka to stop her. She only has two wishes: stop the Dark Elf restoration, and to save her former friend and \"family,\" Isuka! Meanwhile, Takeru finally awakens from the sedative Ikaruga fed him and meets up with Ouka and the girls, now freed. They head towards Ikaruga with over a hundred Dragoons in tow...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-11-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":9.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vnUwVEcIStJQ7KkfG1u5yNg3fvG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vnUwVEcIStJQ7KkfG1u5yNg3fvG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70296/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"1334070","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The 35th platoon investigates two cases: a mysterious love magic artifact from a night club, and a sea monster at a beach where summer won't end. Can they rack up the points they need for promotion?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-12-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":9.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2By8yR9yIOPfKOzhqbOgt2x6Hxk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2By8yR9yIOPfKOzhqbOgt2x6Hxk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/70296/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"1334071","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"During a mission, Takeru runs into his little sister, Kusanagi Kiseki, and reveals the shocking truth to the rest of the platoon.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-12-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":9.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/acAJndIkv2Xu5EuNfoMHtPlqmDL.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a